s=Slide('Listing integration: two contracts currently stop short of a vertical slice','The visible catalog and the direct listing API are separate implementations','Website/data/listings.ts, App.tsx, server/api.mjs; Backend/Listing.cs; DB_Schema.txt','Tristan is credited with the Listing endpoint; Andrew’s reported website work excludes that endpoint and messaging UI. Describe the gap without dismissing delivered code: the current website imports six samples with visual fields such as condition/cover/label, whereas the backend expects Listings title/description/price/category/user_id/datetime and joins User. The adapter exposes no listing route. Listings is absent from the supplied schema and the controller selects ../Data.db independently. CRUD lacks shared auth/ownership checks. These need one agreed schema/DTO/security contract before demonstrating live marketplace persistence.',takeaway='Final vertical slice: signed-in owner creates a persisted listing; another browser retrieves it; unauthorized deletion fails.')
