s=Slide('Next steps: three gates before the final presentation','Dependency order is proposed; calendar dates require the final-presentation deadline','Implementation gaps + current verification; proposed acceptance plan','This is a dependency plan, not invented calendar commitments. Gate 1 completes a persistent authorized listing vertical slice with a declared schema and coherent database path. Gate 2 fixes quality/security blockers and runs current integration/mobile/authorization checks, including the live service-token migration with disposable data and cleanup. Gate 3 freezes a known working build and rehearses a bounded final demonstration with evidence and contribution deltas. Dates and effort cannot be honestly derived without the final deadline; Tristan should anchor this plan after the team supplies it.',takeaway='Finish a coherent, tested slice first; add breadth only after its acceptance conditions pass.')
