s=Slide('Design consistency: one capability across every layer','Requirements, models, routes, storage and evidence must tell the same story','UML/DFD atlases; source contracts; fresh verification','This slide demonstrates design understanding rather than a diagram inventory. Profile editing maps from the use case to Register.Info and AppAuthJson, through PATCH /api/profile and PATCH/GET /Register, to User/Schools and readback-aware tests. Administration uses the caller token and to_user target with Admins rank/locked data; fresh permissions are enforced at adapter and backend. Listing discovery currently maps to imported samples, not a Listings query. The deliberate mismatch is shown as an integration backlog, preventing the team from pretending the diagramed future exists today.',takeaway='A model is accurate when it explains the current boundary and exposes gaps, rather than concealing them.')
