s=Slide('Progress review walkthrough and final-demo acceptance','Use a short, truthful walkthrough tied to implementation evidence','Local build screenshots + test/build artifacts; proposed final acceptance','For this progress review, show the local UI, six samples, category filtering and a local message/offer preview; explain rather than hide that messages stay in memory. Walk through the login sequence and profile request, then show fresh build/test evidence with the one known failure. Save the full live demonstration for final: a disposable student account, persisted owner-authenticated listing, another browser read, rejected unauthorized deletion, allowed cleanup and evidence that no secrets reach the browser. Do not perform live destructive operations just to decorate this review. End by naming ownership and the three gates, not claiming completion percentages.',takeaway='Final readiness means a repeatable cross-layer workflow with correct persistence and permissions, supported by evidence.')
